  "evidencia": "Page: Pomeranian (dog). Sentence: The Pomeranian (often known as a Pom or Pom Pom) is a breed of dog of the Spitz type that is named for the Pomerania region in Germany and Poland in Central Europe.\nPage: Sporting Lucas Terrier. Sentence: The Sporting Lucas Terrier is a small breed of dog of the terrier type.\nPage: Japanese Spitz. Sentence: There are varying standards around the world as to the ideal size of the breed, but they are always larger than their smaller cousins, the Pomeranian.\nPage: Elkhound. Sentence: Elkhounds are a group of Fennoscandian dog breeds belonging to the Spitz-type dogs and used for hunting elk/moose and other large animals.",
